    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a detected community of related process nodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Communities are identified by greedy modularity optimisation (Louvain-style) and can be serialised to RocksDB for later use by the LightRAG retrieval layer. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
